				"text": "Then will I become Hel's bondsman when I am buried there – and Thórir will kneel before me."
			},
			{
				"speaker": "MELKORKA THE KITCHEN SLAVE",
				"text": "Said the girl: “I'll guide him there and thrust him deep if he does not want to freely drink ...”"
			},
			{
				"speaker": "AMLETH",
				"text": "How, how do you ..."
			}
